WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:12.200
In a project, go down to its tasks

2
00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:15.800
Open the task

3
00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:18.300
Pull the sheet up to Attachments

4
00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:21.800
Tap Add Attachment

5
00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:25.800
A photo, a file, a scan — or From Library

6
00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:29.600
Find the file

7
00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:33.400
Tick the file

8
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:36.900
Add

9
00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:41.400
It's on the task now

10
00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:51.000
Tap it to open it
